# Mayhem Devil triggers on its controller's own sacrifice (CR 701.21a): Bot1 sacrifices Black Lotus for mana (a cost) after the Devil
# resolves, and the Devil deals exactly 1 damage to any target - Bot2 goes to 19. "Any target" is a creature, planeswalker, battle or
# player, so Bot1's own Mox Jet (a noncreature artifact) is refused. The opponent-sacrifices case is the sibling scenario.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mayhem Devil
Black Lotus
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mayhem Devil.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
